        "content": "You're pretty direct..."
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  You've been separated from your squad. I'm not here to kill people who don't want a fight.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "You've been separated from your squad. I'm not here to kill people who don't want a fight."
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  We're enemies.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "We're enemies."
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Rhodes Island is here to save the Infected. I saw you helping them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Rhodes Island is here to save the Infected. I saw you helping them."
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Those were my comrades. You're my enemy.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Those were my comrades. You're my enemy."
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  When did Rhodes Island hire someone so naive?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "When did Rhodes Island hire someone so naive?"
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Yes, I'm naive. All I can do is follow orders. I freeze up whenever I have to make a decision for myself.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Yes, I'm naive. All I can do is follow orders. I freeze up whenever I have to make a decision for myself."
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
