        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  You need to be careful.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "You need to be careful."
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Watch your finger!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Watch your finger!"
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  That's a single shot crossbow. If I dodge your bolt, you're dead. Don't pull that trigger.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "That's a single shot crossbow. If I dodge your bolt, you're dead. Don't pull that trigger."
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  If you only follow orders, if you rely on everyone else to tell you what to do, that can only end poorly.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "If you only follow orders, if you rely on everyone else to tell you what to do, that can only end poorly."
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Why?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Most of the sheep who blindly take orders aren't actually dependent on anyone. They just haven't started thinking for themselves...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Most of the sheep who blindly take orders aren't actually dependent on anyone. They just haven't started thinking for themselves..."
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  And those who have no direction in life, they're just empty machines looking for a sense of accomplishment, and meaning.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "And those who have no direction in life, they're just empty machines looking for a sense of accomplishment, and meaning."
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  You activate, and perform your function, you input a goal, you achieve your goal, until you consume everything around you, and you consume those you serve.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "You activate, and perform your function, you input a goal, you achieve your goal, until you consume everything around you, and you consume those you serve."
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  I won't.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "I won't."
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  You're inexperienced.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "You're inexperienced."
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  I saw your interaction with the Infected back there. You're doing the right thing.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "I saw your interaction with the Infected back there. You're doing the right thing."
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Your opinion means nothing to me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Your opinion means nothing to me."
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Faust, you've been avoiding the L. G. D. Even the ones who are out here on their own, you haven't shot at them. I've been watching you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Faust, you've been avoiding the L. G. D. Even the ones who are out here on their own, you haven't shot at them. I've been watching you."
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Don't take my patience for weakness. If I ambushed you, you'd be dead.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Don't take my patience for weakness. If I ambushed you, you'd be dead."
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  But you didn't.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "But you didn't."
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  You're exhausted. Take it from a crossbowman, your string is drawn too tight. It's definitely going to snap.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "You're exhausted. Take it from a crossbowman, your string is drawn too tight. It's definitely going to snap."
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Take it from a crossbowman, you're too much.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Take it from a crossbowman, you're too much."
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  You've also seen those... special Infected. We can figure this one out together.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "You've also seen those... special Infected. We can figure this one out together."
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Maybe you're right.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Maybe you're right."
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Wait!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Wait!"
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1508_Faust_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=0.7)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=1,block=true)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": "1,block=true"
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  But there's nothing I can do.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "But there's nothing I can do."
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1#4"
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  (He disappeared the instant he moved...? I can't figure his position!)",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "(He disappeared the instant he moved...? I can't figure his position!)"
    },
    {
        "id": 149,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 150,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  ......hm?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "......hm?"
    },
    {
        "id": 152,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Why haven't you killed me?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Why haven't you killed me?"
    },
    {
        "id": 153,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 154,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  You didn't shoot. Neither will I.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "You didn't shoot. Neither will I."
    },
    {
        "id": 155,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  But next time? If you don't kill me, I will kill you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "But next time? If you don't kill me, I will kill you."
    },
    {
        "id": 156,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 157,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  I don't want to hurt you!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "I don't want to hurt you!"
    },
    {
        "id": 158,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  That's too bad.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "That's too bad."
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  I guess you need someone to answer you. Without an answer, you can't understand.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "I guess you need someone to answer you. Without an answer, you can't understand."
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Don't worry about it. Killing, dying, these are everyday facts of life. Even for Rhodes Island.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Don't worry about it. Killing, dying, these are everyday facts of life. Even for Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Why can't we work together to save them?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Why can't we work together to save them?"
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 165,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  I really wish I could. But I know I can't.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "I really wish I could. But I know I can't."
    },
    {
        "id": 166,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  Don't follow me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "Don't follow me."
    },
    {
        "id": 167,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  You still don't know them. You don't yet have the whole picture.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "You still don't know them. You don't yet have the whole picture."
    },
    {
        "id": 168,
        "raw": "[name=\"Faust\"]  ...and me? There's nothing I can do anymore.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Faust",
        "content": "...and me? There's nothing I can do anymore."
    },
